error[ffi_unknown_field]: `fixedbugs-152-fields.h` declares no `x` in `anon_u`: clang read the header, and that type has no such field
  at tests/golden/unsupported/fixedbugs-152-a-field-the-header-lacks-in-a-union.hero:15:9
     |
  15 |         x: u32  #~ ffi_unknown_field
     |         ^
  note: a group's `record` IS the header's type (spec § 13), so a field is named exactly as the header names it, and `fixedbugs-152-fields.h` gives `anon_u` these members: `i`, `n`; a `partial` record names those the program reads
